}
====================================================================


        This compiled and linked on the SUN, and stored the executable
as "a.out" (UNIX convention if not specified) on Cluster 4 as A.OUT;1.
I ran it on the SUN with no problems.

====================================================================
[wws@microjet] a.out
this program was created on VMS!!!
[wws@microjet]
====================================================================


