>          our problem is machine just powering itself down.  Have had 
>          environmental consultant in to look due to the fact that
>          so far the problem is isolated to the Development 
>          equipment and has not been seen in the 12 other Alpha's 
>          in QA and Production, but received a clean bill of 
>          health.  Early this week, Digital thought they finally 
