any other -11.  But the way interrupt vectors are asserted on the
so-called bus is a little wierd.

There is no DMA on the Pro series at all.  Although the DMA signals
are specified on the C-bus, and the PRO tech manuals have all the DMA
timing diagrams, there was actually a decision at DEC to disable DMA
on the beast.  (It was probably a trade-off for something else that
the P/OS people thought was needed more.)

	- Jack

