> The September 12 issue of Digital News & Review, reporting
> on the new DEC 300 Model 700 (and 900), lists as a disadvantage
> their inability to run Windows NT. (page 39)
> 
> Does anyone know why?  Is it something in the 21064A?  Perhaps
> the workstation architecture?  Or could it be a marketing 
