It's a resource allocation decision.  New HAL routines and drivers would
have to be written to support the TurboChannel and I/O devices on the
TurboChannel.  DEC apparently felt that not enough sales of these boxes
would depend on NT being available for them, not enough to justify the
cost of doing the HAL and drivers.

